            <title>[IGNITE-7091] PDS Compatibilty: Assertion error in case serializer V1 is found and there is no next segment to read in WAL iterator</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-7091</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
